# Personal wallpaper libraries can be several gigabytes and may contain
# third-party art. Keep only the documented folder placeholders in Git.
wallpapers/WallpapersDark/**
!wallpapers/WallpapersDark/STRATA_LOGO_DARK.jpg
wallpapers/WallpapersLight/**
!wallpapers/WallpapersLight/STRATA_LOGO_LIGHT.jpg

# Local operating-system and shell state lives outside the repository, but
# ignore defensive copies if somebody places them here while debugging.
settings.json
installation.json
shell-backup.json
shell-launcher.json
self-test.json

# Exclude agent chat logs
docs/agent-conversations/

